# PROJECT CONVENTIONS (the generated code follows them - so must you)
- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only for interactivity. No `useEffect` data fetching.
- Client data: `import { api } from "@/trpc/react";` -> `api.<router>.<proc>.useQuery()/useMutation()`,
  invalidate with `const utils = api.useUtils(); utils.<router>.<proc>.invalidate()`.
- Server components: `import { api } from "@/trpc/server";` -> `await api.<router>.<proc>(input)`.
- Session: `import { auth } from "@/server/auth";` (server only). Pages under /dashboard are protected by middleware.
- tRPC routers live in `src/server/api/routers/<name>.ts`:
  ```typescript
  import { z } from "zod";
  import { createTRPCRouter, protectedProcedure } from "@/server/api/trpc";
  export const projectRouter = createTRPCRouter({
    list: protectedProcedure.query(({ ctx }) =>
      ctx.db.project.findMany({ where: { userId: ctx.session.user.id } })),
    create: protectedProcedure.input(z.object({ name: z.string().min(1) }))
      .mutation(({ ctx, input }) => ctx.db.project.create({ data: { ...input, userId: ctx.session.user.id } })),
  });
  ```
  A NEW router must also be imported and added to `appRouter` in `src/server/api/root.ts`.
- Prisma: only via `ctx.db` (tRPC) or `db` from `@/server/db` (server components). Prisma delegates are
  camelCase (`ctx.db.blogPost`). Schema changes go to `prisma/schema.prisma` (both sides of a relation).
- Errors: `TRPCError` with codes (`NOT_FOUND`, `UNAUTHORIZED`, `FORBIDDEN`, `BAD_REQUEST`, `CONFLICT`).
- UI: shadcn/ui from `@/components/ui/*` (button, input, label, card, badge exist once add_shadcn_ui ran),
  Tailwind utility classes, `cn` from `@/lib/utils`.
- Imports use the `@/` alias. `PascalCase` components, `camelCase` variables, `kebab-case` file names.
- Strict TypeScript: no `any`, no `@ts-ignore`, no `eslint-disable`. ESLint runs with --max-warnings=0.
- Unit tests: Vitest, `*.test.ts` next to the code (node environment).
- Do NOT add npm dependencies: package.json already contains the whole stack and new packages are not installed.

